{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 115,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Not to us, LORD, not to us, but to your name give glory, for your loving kindness, and for your truth’s sake.",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "115:1 LORD or GOD in all caps is from the Hebrew יהוה Yahweh except when otherwise noted as being from the short form יה Yah."
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，荣耀不要归与我们，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，榮耀不要歸與我們，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "Why should the nations say, Where is their God, now?”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "为何容外邦人说：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "為何容外邦人說：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "But our God is in the heavens. He does whatever he pleases.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "然而，我们的 神在天上，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "然而，我們的上帝在天上，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "Their idols are silver and gold, the work of men’s hands.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他们的偶像是金的，银的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他們的偶像是金的，銀的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "They have mouths, but they don’t speak. They have eyes, but they don’t see.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "有口却不能言，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "有口卻不能言，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "They have ears, but they don’t hear. They have noses, but they don’t smell.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "有耳却不能听，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "有耳卻不能聽，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "They have hands, but they don’t feel. They have feet, but they don’t walk, neither do they speak through their throat.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "有手却不能摸，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "有手卻不能摸，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "Those who make them will be like them; everyone who trusts in them.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "造他的要和他一样；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "造他的要和他一樣；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "Israel, trust in the LORD! He is their help and their shield.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "啊，你要倚靠耶和华！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "啊，你要倚靠耶和華！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "House of Aaron, trust in the LORD! He is their help and their shield.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "家啊，你们要倚靠耶和华！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "家啊，你們要倚靠耶和華！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "You who fear the LORD, trust in the LORD! He is their help and their shield.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们敬畏耶和华的，要倚靠耶和华！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們敬畏耶和華的，要倚靠耶和華！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD remembers us. He will bless us. He will bless the house of Israel. He will bless the house of Aaron.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华向来眷念我们； ： 的家， 的家。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華向來眷念我們； ： 的家， 的家。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "He will bless those who fear the LORD, small and great.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "凡敬畏耶和华的，无论大小，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "凡敬畏耶和華的，無論大小，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "14",
      "en": {
        "text": "May the LORD increase you more and more, you and your children.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "愿耶和华叫你们",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "願耶和華叫你們",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "15",
      "en": {
        "text": "Blessed are you by the LORD, who made heaven and earth.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们蒙了造天地之耶和华的福！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們蒙了造天地之耶和華的福！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "16",
      "en": {
        "text": "The heavens are the LORD’s heavens, but he has given the earth to the children of men.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "天，是耶和华的天；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "天，是耶和華的天；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "17",
      "en": {
        "text": "The dead don’t praise the LORD, nor any who go down into silence,",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "115:17 Hebrew: יה Yah"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "死人不能赞美耶和华；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "死人不能讚美耶和華；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "18",
      "en": {
        "text": "but we will bless the LORD, from this time forward and forever more. Praise the LORD!",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "115:18 Hebrew: יה Yah"
          },
          {
            "id": "f2",
            "text": "115:18 Hebrew: יה Yah"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "但我们要称颂耶和华，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "但我們要稱頌耶和華，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}